# Reviewed study outputs may be tracked by Git.
# .gitignore cannot filter by file size. The independent Git size policy
# rejects staged/unapproved blobs greater than 50,000,000 bytes.
# Before committing output files, run:
#   python scripts/check_git_file_sizes.py --staged
# Original/raw and intermediate source datasets remain ignored above.
